(* Note: Srqs Deal Response fills what is left of the frame Body Len       *)
(* states, which is what it is read from.                                  *)
(*                                                                         *)
(* Note: Srqs Inquire Smart Respondent Response fills what is left of the  *)
(* frame Body Len states, which is what it is read from.                   *)
(*                                                                         *)
(* Note: Srqs Negotiation Notification fills what is left of the frame     *)
(* Body Len states, which is what it is read from.                         *)
(*                                                                         *)
(* Note: Srqs Negotiation Requester Notification fills what is left of the *)
