(* Note: Srqs Open Negotiation Requester Notification fills what is left   *)
(* of the frame Body Len states, which is what it is read from.            *)
(*                                                                         *)
(* Note: Srqs Quote Notification fills what is left of the frame Body Len  *)
(* states, which is what it is read from.                                  *)
